  "blockers": [],
  "knownGaps": [
    "Compensation records a receipt and logs that it does not reach the owning service: there is no transport for asking another service to undo a step, so a compensation is recorded as attempted rather than performed. This is the largest remaining gap in this task and it is visible in the code, not only here.",
    "The gateway's bounded in-memory sink remains the default when the durable settings are absent: gateway.audit.ingest-uri and its three companions are empty unless the environment supplies them, so a deployment that has not opted in keeps the old behaviour.",
    "The service client's secret is a local development value in the runner. A deployment needs it injected, and the rotation the ADR names is not implemented.",
    "The audit ingest accepts a service token type now, but nothing yet limits which service may claim audit.ingest beyond the permissions the client is granted at configuration time.",
    "The workflow service is not in the owner manifest, so its schema and credentials come from the same local scripts as the platform services rather than from a per-service migration path."
  ],
